{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_t007r0501_stafff_01",
      "hash": "6271286d67cc858d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "歡迎光臨！\\n歡迎來到玉虹百貨公司！\\c\\n請到裡面的指示牌\\n查看樓層指南。"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_t007r0501_kanban_01",
      "hash": "45ae0e4cd6dbedb4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "１樓……　服務櫃台\\n２樓……　訓練家市集\\c\\n３樓……　電子遊戲專賣店\\n４樓……　聰明人禮品店\\c\\n５樓……　飾品市集\\n頂樓……　自動販賣機"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_t007r0501_kanban_02",
      "hash": "45ae114cd6dbf2cd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 2]"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_t007r0501_poster_01",
      "hash": "2ab24a8c016ec932",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "玉虹市道館\\n館主專訪！\\c\\n「不管是挑戰者還是良機，\\n我會靜待他們的來臨。」"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_t007r0501_adultm_01",
      "hash": "a283866ac6a35e84",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "呼～！百貨公司\\n有椅子真好！\\c\\n……[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳長大後就會明白了。"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_t007r0501_oldf_01",
      "hash": "bba12a981d93f1de",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我沒什麼要買的。\\c\\n可是，只要到這裡來\\n就能見到我的朋友。"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_t007r0501_youngf_01",
      "hash": "7c2ac910457384d7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我想要\\n寶可夢的飾品～！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_t007r0501_youngm_01",
      "hash": "084041586d0bf1f8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……要到５樓去很吃力啊，\\n不如回家吧？"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_t007r0501_max",
